OFME Fleet Agent connects an OPNsense firewall to OPNsense Fleet Manager
Enterprise (OFME).

The agent enrolls the appliance using a one-time enrollment token and an
X.509 certificate signed by the OFME device CA. Afterwards it authenticates
every request with mutual TLS, publishes telemetry every heartbeat, polls
for operational commands, renews its certificate before expiry and can
apply centrally managed aliases and firewall policy.

